usage: odds_api_snapshot.py [-h] --sha256 SHA256 --received-at RECEIVED_AT
                            [--event-id EVENT_ID] --output OUTPUT
                            raw

Offline The Odds API v4 receipt decoder, independent of protected collectors.
This module does not fetch odds or open a database. It preserves a complete
response as one observation, including empty/invalid states. A changed-at
clock and the presence of an odd never certify commercial availability or
execution.

positional arguments:
  raw

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --sha256 SHA256
  --received-at RECEIVED_AT
  --event-id EVENT_ID
  --output OUTPUT
